# S16-S17-slop: S16-S17-classic in the slop preset, only the frames S17 needs (444 on; the
# game still runs from frame 0, so the two stay in step).
#
# Assembly: S16 is S16-S17-classic's frames 0 to 563, "Classic" at the 4:3 box's top left.
# S17 is frames 444 to 869: S16-S17-slop, "slop" at its top left, wipes in from the left
# over the Classic picture between film seconds 8.4 and 10.0 (smoothstep), behind a
# 4-pixel bronze line. Each label sits on a 60% dark band.

map start

duration 14.5
fps 60
size 1920x1080
frames 444..870

preset slop
hud on
gun on
cvar gamma 0.7

camera path
key 0     544,269.44,54  0,90  ease linear
key 14.5  544,538.56,54  0,90

events on
